*PPD-Adobe: "4.3"
*% ELVIS Gastdrucker: nimmt PDF an (CUPS wandelt andere Formate vorher) und reicht es an ELVIS weiter.
*% Farbe und Duplex sind nur Angebote an das Gerät – wie gedruckt wird, entscheidet ELVIS.
*FormatVersion: "4.3"
*FileVersion: "1.0"
*LanguageVersion: German
*LanguageEncoding: ISOLatin1
*PCFileName: "ELVISGST.PPD"
*Manufacturer: "ELVIS"
*Product: "(ELVIS Gastdrucker)"
*ModelName: "ELVIS Gastdrucker"
*ShortNickName: "ELVIS Gastdrucker"
*NickName: "ELVIS Gastdrucker"
*PSVersion: "(3010.000) 0"
*LanguageLevel: "3"
*ColorDevice: True
*DefaultColorSpace: RGB
*FileSystem: False
*Throughput: "10"
*LandscapeOrientation: Plus90
*TTRasterizer: Type42
*cupsVersion: 2.4
*cupsManualCopies: False
*cupsFilter2: "application/pdf application/pdf 0 -"
*cupsFilter2: "application/vnd.cups-pdf application/pdf 0 -"

*OpenUI *PageSize/Papierformat: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageSize
*DefaultPageSize: A4
*PageSize A4/A4: "<</PageSize[595 842]>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize A5/A5: "<</PageSize[420 595]>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize Letter/Letter: "<</PageSize[612 792]>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize Legal/Legal: "<</PageSize[612 1008]>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageSize

*OpenUI *PageRegion: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageRegion
*DefaultPageRegion: A4
*PageRegion A4/A4: "<</PageSize[595 842]>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion A5/A5: "<</PageSize[420 595]>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion Letter/Letter: "<</PageSize[612 792]>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion Legal/Legal: "<</PageSize[612 1008]>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageRegion

*DefaultImageableArea: A4
*ImageableArea A4: "0 0 595 842"
*ImageableArea A5: "0 0 420 595"
*ImageableArea Letter: "0 0 612 792"
*ImageableArea Legal: "0 0 612 1008"
*DefaultPaperDimension: A4
*PaperDimension A4: "595 842"
*PaperDimension A5: "420 595"
*PaperDimension Letter: "612 792"
*PaperDimension Legal: "612 1008"

*OpenUI *Duplex/Beidseitig: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *Duplex
*DefaultDuplex: None
*Duplex None/Einseitig: ""
*Duplex DuplexNoTumble/Lange Kante: ""
*Duplex DuplexTumble/Kurze Kante: ""
*CloseUI: *Duplex

*OpenUI *ColorModel/Farbe: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *ColorModel
*DefaultColorModel: RGB
*ColorModel RGB/Farbe: ""
*ColorModel Gray/Graustufen: ""
*CloseUI: *ColorModel
